      "text": "fct_order_items    ATOMIC SALES FACT\ngrain: one order line\n(order_id + order_item_id) \u00b7 ~112,650\n\nFK  purchase date   \u2192 dim_date\nFK  customer_key    \u2192 dim_customer\nFK  product_key     \u2192 dim_product\nFK  seller_key      \u2192 dim_seller\nDD  order_id \u00b7 order_item_id\n\nprice \u00b7 freight_value\nline_gross_value = price + freight_value\n\nPARTITION BY order_purchase_date\nCLUSTER BY product_key, seller_key",
      "originalText": "fct_order_items    ATOMIC SALES FACT\ngrain: one order line\n(order_id + order_item_id) \u00b7 ~112,650\n\nFK  purchase date   \u2192 dim_date\nFK  customer_key    \u2192 dim_customer\nFK  product_key     \u2192 dim_product\nFK  seller_key      \u2192 dim_seller\nDD  order_id \u00b7 order_item_id\n\nprice \u00b7 freight_value\nline_gross_value = price + freight_value\n\nPARTITION BY order_purchase_date\nCLUSTER BY product_key, seller_key",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fct_order_items",
