      "type": "text",
      "text": "fct_orders   ACCUMULATING SNAPSHOT\ngrain: one order \u00b7 ~99,441\n\nFK  order_purchase_date \u2192 dim_date\nFK  customer_key        \u2192 dim_customer\nDD  order_id \u00b7 order_status\n\nitem_count \u00b7 payment_count\nitem_gross_total \u00b7 payment_value_total\npayment_difference \u00b7 reconciled flag\napproval_days \u00b7 handover_days\ndelivery_days \u00b7 estimated_vs_actual_days\nis_late",
      "originalText": "fct_orders   ACCUMULATING SNAPSHOT\ngrain: one order \u00b7 ~99,441\n\nFK  order_purchase_date \u2192 dim_date\nFK  customer_key        \u2192 dim_customer\nDD  order_id \u00b7 order_status\n\nitem_count \u00b7 payment_count\nitem_gross_total \u00b7 payment_value_total\npayment_difference \u00b7 reconciled flag\napproval_days \u00b7 handover_days\ndelivery_days \u00b7 estimated_vs_actual_days\nis_late",
