      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Solid arrow   = FK to a conformed dimension\nDashed arrow  = degenerate order_id link\nPK = primary key \u00b7 FK = foreign key \u00b7 DD = degenerate\n\nPartitioning is ~free at 120 MB; it is declared because\nthe grain and access pattern would demand it at 1000\u00d7.",
      "originalText": "Solid arrow   = FK to a conformed dimension\nDashed arrow  = degenerate order_id link\nPK = primary key \u00b7 FK = foreign key \u00b7 DD = degenerate\n\nPartitioning is ~free at 120 MB; it is declared because\nthe grain and access pattern would demand it at 1000\u00d7.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legend2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
